Client --> CFR002 : "Receive Alerts for Anomalous Transactions"
Client --> CFR003 : "View Financial Predictions"
Client --> CFR004 : "Receive Personalized Recommendations"
Client --> CFR005 : "Manage Recommendation Preferences"
Client --> CFR006 : "View Spending Limit Alerts"
Client --> CFR007 : "View Investment Opportunities"
Client --> CFR008 : "View News Related to Portfolio"
Client --> CFR009 : "Access Personalized Dashboard"
Client --> CFR10 : "Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors"

FAdvisor --> FAFR001 : "Manage Client Mentoring Sessions"
FAdvisor --> FAFR002 : "View Client Intervention Alerts"
FAdvisor --> FAFR003 : "View Predictive Analytics for Clients"
FAdvisor --> FAFR004 : "Configure Analysis Parameters for Client Segments"

SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : "Manage Analysis Parameters for AI System"

AIFR001 --> SFR002 : "Generate Personalized Recommendations"
